Apply CoreAudio HAL render period to all render streams (not only Black Ops 1).
On Bluetooth / 44.1 kHz / 512-frame devices (11.61 ms HAL block > Wine 10.0 ms
default period), WaW (XAudio2_0), BO2 (XAudio2_7) and other games underran on
every ~6th callback and crackled/fluttered. Devices with HAL blocks <= 10 ms
keep Wine's 10 ms period unchanged. Opt-out: SIL_COREAUDIO_HAL_PERIOD=0.
Apply after wine-coreaudio-bo1-period.patch and wine-coreaudio-bo1-steam.patch.

